    <informations>Shelly i4 Gen4 — mounting view.
Terminals, left to right as printed: SW4 SW3 SW2 SW1 L L N.

Official sources:
https://kb.shelly.cloud/knowledge-base/shelly-i4-gen4
https://kb.shelly.cloud/__attachments/a_10bf666c1598fc866911f645720d7ecfe9a0a29e61a21c038a14eda1a3c31499/Shelly%20i4%20Gen4.jpg?cb=fb514d98a97f01adb4a4c9a94a96e68e
https://kb.shelly.cloud/__attachments/a_45ae8d994e7eeb5fd52717b4ae31eeb8c490be4e5edcded8f8d8ef742735558d/Plus-addon-interface.png?cb=b6f7e5e1b58d2ac8e3a97827cc15dc11
https://kb.shelly.cloud/__attachments/a_ba2479a890c84767f406bd12a87c284e42a78c637bf8b8ea0b1b31a8fdb18644/Shelly%20i4%20Gen4%20multilingual%20printed%20user%20and%20safety%20guide.pdf?cb=54e1efa61e61a207462bc9382c062d5f

Notes:
- Depth15mm in current official KB, rather than16mm inGen3.

Nominal dimensions and an illustrative outline: corner radii, screw pitch and recesses are drawn to be recognisable, not to manufacturing CAD.</informations>
